      "content": "i dont even know why im typing this. i just realized my entire dataset for the last three years is basically unusable. a script error wiped the raw files and the backups are corrupted too. i spent years building this. my advisor, my whole lab... they're all gonna see i'm just a fraud. i cant go back to the lab tomorrow. i feel like my life is just... done. there's nothing left to even try for.",
