    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it's not just a loss. it's everything. the more i think about it, the more i realize there's no path back from this. i can't restart three years, i can't face my committee, and i honestly can't stand the thought of pretending to be okay while i'm just an empty shell. it feels like the version of me that actually mattered is just gone. like, what's even the point of being here if the one thing i was supposed to do is gone?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
